data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"This is the mission dispatch. The mission: deliver src/greet.py with greet(name) returning \"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\" and tests/test_greet.py covering a normal name and the empty string, with `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exiting 0.\n\nMy plan as orchestrator:\n1. Write a plan note (optional but good practice).\n2. Send the work to dev with a dispatch file containing everything dev needs.\n3. Wait for dev's reply.\n4. Judge: fetch dev's branch, verify the criteria myself.\n5. Accept if good, or send rework.\n6. Reply to m1 with the outcome.\n\nLet me set up a todo list and start. First, let me check the subject repo state briefly to understand the base (I own no code but can look). Actually, as orchestrator I write no code, but I can inspect. Let me first write the dispatch file for dev.\n\nLet me check the repo state first to give dev accurate context."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1787897302,"id":"chatcmpl-41996e7c20f3492fa435d2ba4b139aad","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

